OL,3,AHeathrow and Gatwick among airports hit
OL,4,Aby air traffic control problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights from airports in the UK and
OL,7,FIreland are being heavily disrupted by
OL,8,Fa technical problem affecting the air
OL,9,Ftraffic control provider Nats.
OL,11,FHeathrow, Gatwick, Stansted, East
OL,12,FMidlands and Dublin are among those to
OL,13,Fwarn of potential delays.
OL,15,FAt Heathrow, departures were initially
OL,16,Fpaused around lunchtime. Traffic then
OL,17,Fresumed, before facing further
OL,18,Fdisruption in the afternoon. It is
OL,19,Funderstood that very few flights are
OL,20,Fcurrently taking off.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
