OL,3,AHeathrow and Gatwick among airports hit
OL,4,Aby air traffic control problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish Airways has already cancelled a
OL,7,Fnumber short-haul services. The airline
OL,8,Fis prioritising long-haul departures.
